# Fear of Surveillance: "Vigilance. Whenever this creature attacks, surveil 1." It is cast on turn 1 and attacks on turns 3 and 5.
# Vigilance: it is still untapped after attacking. Each attack surveils 1 (CR 701.25a): on turn 3 Lightning Bolt is put into the
# graveyard, on turn 5 Giant Growth is kept on top of the library.

